  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Quilted Woobie Jacket is a fusion of iconic style and modern comfort. Crafted with inspiration from the classic military poncho liner, this jacket delivers unbeatable warmth without the weight. Its quilted 100% polyester outer shell ensures durability and style, while the 6oz jar quilting provides just the right amount of insulation for spring, fall, and mild winters.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133026",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's Quilted Woobie Jacket is a fusion of iconic style and modern comfort. Crafted with inspiration from the classic military poncho liner, this jacket delivers unbeatable warmth without the weight. Its quilted 100% polyester outer shell ensures durability and style, while the 6oz jar quilting provides just the right amount of insulation for spring, fall, and mild winters. Stay comfortable on your next hike or camping trip with this mid-weight jacket that offers essential warmth and a touch of active-duty inspired flair. Featuring a secure 4-button closure, this jacket ensures a snug fit to keep the cold at bay. 2 lower front hand pockets with zippered closure offer high-capacity storage space for your essentials, while the 4 inch x 4 inch loop field on the right sleeve provides the perfect spot for adding your favorite patches or a US flag patch. Additionally, the ribbed knit collar and cuffs add a rugged accent to the Woobie Jacket, completing its rugged yet fashionable look. Whether you're braving the outdoors or simply running errands around town, this jacket is designed to keep you comfortable and rugged. With its blend of classic military design and modern functionality, the Rothco Quilted Woobie Jacket is sure to become your go-to outerwear choice for all your adventures.</p>",
